{"date":"1984-08-12","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/71/cb/136883_zSaOX.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/71/cb/136883_zSaOX.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/71/cb/136883_zSaOX.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/71/cb/136883_zSaOX.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/71/cb/136883_zSaOX.jpg"},"summary":"　　少年跳跃着穿过街道，他越跳越高，跨越了城市、森林和海洋。他依然不停地跳着，跳得越来越高，越来越远。然而，在这无尽的跳跃中，他最终意外地跳进了战火纷飞的国度。一个小男孩轻松愉快的跳跃，最终演变成了审视人类命运的深刻跃迁，这便是这部作品的巧妙之处。整部作品采用一镜到底的拍摄手法，制作了共计4000帧的画面，曾令世界为之惊叹，并斩获了诸多奖项。","name":"ジャンピング","name_cn":"跳跃","tags":[{"name":"短片","count":167,"total_count":101544},{"name":"手塚治虫","count":115,"total_count":2904},{"name":"1984","count":102,"total_count":3257},{"name":"原创","count":63,"total_count":613886},{"name":"手塚PRODUCTION","count":57,"total_count":5020},{"name":"实验动画","count":22,"total_count":2321},{"name":"试验","count":20,"total_count":29},{"name":"上世纪","count":12,"total_count":449},{"name":"1980s","count":11,"total_count":1096},{"name":"剧场版","count":11,"total_count":718653},{"name":"手冢治虫","count":11,"total_count":2708},{"name":"80年代","count":9,"total_count":2190},{"name":"日本","count":8,"total_count":290044},{"name":"手塚プロダクション","count":6,"total_count":205},{"name":"日本动画","count":4,"total_count":34754},{"name":"手冢Production","count":3,"total_count":2193},{"name":"OVA","count":2,"total_count":362539},{"name":"短篇","count":2,"total_count":2748},{"name":"动画","count":2,"total_count":35443},{"name":"作画","count":2,"total_count":2151},{"name":"Short","count":2,"total_count":1536},{"name":"80-84","count":2,"total_count":77},{"name":"1984年8月","count":2,"total_count":3},{"name":"动画的世纪","count":1,"total_count":78},{"name":"动画短片","count":1,"total_count":2069},{"name":"80","count":1,"total_count":188},{"name":"(细项略)","count":1,"total_count":45},{"name":"8月","count":1,"total_count":217},{"name":"Short_film","count":1,"total_count":431},{"name":"上中","count":1,"total_count":87}],"infob